abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for a study of evolutionary dynamics in which the payoff
  earned in a technological race and the payoff that governs replication of a
  design are different functions of the same interaction. Provides exact
  evaluation of the reduced AI-race game, closed-form liability thresholds,
  replicator and finite-population dynamics via EGTtools, and an
  eco-evolutionary ratchet with hysteresis.
keywords:
  - evolutionary game theory
  - replicator dynamics
  - technological race
  - bistability
  - hysteresis
  - liability
  - AI safety
